[0m[0m
- **Read/Seek helpers**: Private methods [38;5;10mread_u8()[0m, [38;5;10mread_u32()[0m, [38;5;10mread_u32_vec()[0m, and [38;5;10mread_string()[0m handle all binary parsing from the in-memory buffer using little-endian byte order.[0m[0m
[0m[0m
- **Sequence construction**: [38;5;10mconstruct_sequence_immut()[0m is an [38;5;10m&self[0m version that works with the data buffer directly, since [38;5;10mtwobit_sequence[0m takes [38;5;10m&self[0m. The [38;5;10mbytes2bases[0m and [38;5;10mbyte2base[0m helpers faithfully translate the 2-bit packed encoding (T=0, C=1, A=2, G=3).[0m[0m
