[0m[0m
- **Base counting** ([38;5;10mtwobit_bases[0m): Returns [38;5;10mVec<u8>[0m containing either 4 [38;5;10mf64[0m values (fraction mode) or 4 [38;5;10mu32[0m values (count mode) in ACTG order as little-endian bytes, matching the C behavior.[0m[0m
